[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "今の声は……？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "localized_name": "イザナ",
    "romanized_name": "Izana",
    "model_path_hash": 2294695844032883758,
    "text": "わー！　急に曇ったね！　びっくり！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7010833269667927555,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "ええ。それに曇る直前、何か魔物のような声が\n聞こえた気がするのだけど……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "いったん、宿に帰りましょうか。\nこの格好で雨に降られたら、風邪ひいちゃうわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "localized_name": "イザナ",
    "romanized_name": "Izana",
    "model_path_hash": 2294695844032883758,
    "text": "うん、鍛錬の続きはまた今度教えてください！\nそれじゃ、まずはみんなと合流する？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7010833269667927555,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "そうね。\nアルビーナたち、どこまで行ったのかしら……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "localized_name": "現地住民Ａ",
    "romanized_name": "",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "ねえ、大変！　海岸に魔物が近づいてきてるって！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 0,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "localized_name": "現地住民Ｂ",
    "romanized_name": "",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "それって、この前近海に出た大型のヤツ！？\nもしかして、この天気も……？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 0,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "localized_name": "現地住民Ａ",
    "romanized_name": "",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "そうかも……警備隊が動いてくれてるけど、\n念のため避難しろって話！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 0,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "localized_name": "イザナ",
    "romanized_name": "Izana",
    "model_path_hash": 2294695844032883758,
    "text": "ヤンネさん、今の聞こえた！？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7010833269667927555,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "ええ。大型の魔物……心配ね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "localized_name": "イェルカ",
    "romanized_name": "Jelka",
    "model_path_hash": 7989768780593008340,
    "text": "お二人さん、この辺りは避難指示が出ているよ。\nすぐにここから離れたほうがいい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8715905000688515801,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "localized_name": "イザナ",
    "romanized_name": "Izana",
    "model_path_hash": 2294695844032883758,
    "text": "イェルカ！　もしかして、\n九偉人が出るほど危険な魔物なの？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7010833269667927555,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "localized_name": "イェルカ",
    "romanized_name": "Jelka",
    "model_path_hash": 7989768780593008340,
    "text": "いや、アタシは避難誘導のお手伝いってとこさね。\n魔物の対処には、この島の警備隊が向かってるよ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8715905000688515801,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "それじゃあ、\nそこまで危険な魔物ではないということね……？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "localized_name": "イェルカ",
    "romanized_name": "Jelka",
    "model_path_hash": 7989768780593008340,
    "text": "そうだろうと踏んでいるけれど、この天気……\nもしかしたら予想を上回る危険な魔物の可能性もある",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8715905000688515801,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "localized_name": "イェルカ",
    "romanized_name": "Jelka",
    "model_path_hash": 7989768780593008340,
    "text": "その場合は、アタシたち九偉人の出番さね。\n今はとりあえず、みんなの避難誘導を――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8715905000688515801,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "イェルカ、アルビーナたちを見ていないかしら？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "localized_name": "イェルカ",
    "romanized_name": "Jelka",
    "model_path_hash": 7989768780593008340,
    "text": "いや、今日は見ていないね……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8715905000688515801,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "……心配だわ。私、探してくる",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "localized_name": "イザナ",
    "romanized_name": "Izana",
    "model_path_hash": 2294695844032883758,
    "text": "ヤンネさん！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7010833269667927555,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "大丈夫。ちゃんと武器は持って行くし、\n私は聖戦士よ。安心して",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "イザナさんも、レスナちゃんたちと合流しなさい。\nあの子の騎士なのでしょう",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "localized_name": "イザナ",
    "romanized_name": "Izana",
    "model_path_hash": 2294695844032883758,
    "text": "……うん、分かった！\nヤンネさん、気を付けて！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7010833269667927555,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "localized_name": "イェルカ",
    "romanized_name": "Jelka",
    "model_path_hash": 7989768780593008340,
    "text": "やれやれ、どれだけ危険かも分からないのに……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8715905000688515801,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "localized_name": "イェルカ",
    "romanized_name": "Jelka",
    "model_path_hash": 7989768780593008340,
    "text": "アルビーたち、愛されてるじゃないか",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8715905000688515801,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  }
]